  "description": "Morzine is the most charming base village on the French side of Portes du Soleil. Traditional wooden chalets, a lively central square, genuine Haute-Savoie culture and traditions. Linked to Avoriaz via a cable car from its centre, giving access to the full 600km Portes du Soleil. Excellent year-round destination with mountain biking in summer. Balanced apres \u2014 lively but not wild. A real village, not a purpose-built resort.",
